  (text "INPUT OVP (primary side)\nTrip = 2.495 V x (1 + 191k/10k) = 50.2 V rising\nHysteresis ~0.4 V (R84 2.2M)\nOVP_P high = over-voltage -> U12 VI1 -> VO1\n-> VIN_OVP -> PA15 (HRTIM1_FLT2 / EXTI15)"
    (at 124.46 152.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 14fe43c6-37db-4844-a7b3-12411282e920)
  )
  (text "VIN MONITOR (primary side, monitoring only)\nRamp 0 -> 2.495 V in ~5 ms (Q9 ~24 uA into C82 47n C0G), reset ~20 us by U17/D7/C81/Q10\nU18: VINPWM_P high while RAMP < OVP_DIV (R110 hysteresis on the divider side)  ->  U12 VI2 -> VO2 -> VIN_PWM -> PA2 (TIM15_CH1 PWM input)\nVIN = 50.47 V x (t_high - t_reset) / (period - t_reset) - 0.20 V,  t_reset ~20 us; calibrate once"
    (at 40.64 256.54 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 5553f3c4-ec70-4e34-9d09-0c990bcdd9a7)
  )

